{"id":21043,"name":"两个人的演唱会","rarity":4,"path":"Knight","desc":"存护命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「哥哥，这是……」 </i>\\n<i>「好久没有快乐地唱过歌了吧…我为你搭了一座舞台，就是…有点简陋。」 </i>\\n<i>「可老师觉得我不适合……」 </i>\\n<i>「不，我觉得很好听！以后你一定会实现自己的梦想，站在更大的舞台上歌唱……」 </i>\\n……\\n\\n许多年之后，她站在璀璨的舞台上，望着底下汹涌的粉丝，却失神了片刻——\\n在漫长的追梦路上，她总会想起那道信任的目光，和自己的第一场「演唱会」。\\n没有绚丽的灯光，没有华美的妆造，有的只是一个孩子为了鼓励另一个孩子追求梦想而搭建起的舞台。\\n\\n<i>「如今，我们的梦都实现了。但…那还是属于『我们』的梦吗……」 </i>\\n她握紧了话筒。在下一首歌开始之前，她甚至来不及感到悲伤。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21043,"name":"鼓舞","desc":"使装备者的防御力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。场上每有一名持有护盾的角色，装备者造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.16,0.04]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.2,0.05]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.06]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.28,0.07]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.32,0.08]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":16.8,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":36.96,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110211,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":63.84,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110212,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":90.72,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110212,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":117.6,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110213,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114013,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":371.52,"hp_add":6